    "あなた" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたに制限時間はありません。設定の「ゆっくりモード」をオンにすると、CPU はさらにゆっくりになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have no time limit. Turn on \"Slow Mode\" in Settings to make the CPU even slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの勝ち" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You win"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの山札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your stock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは出せません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "can't play yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この台札に置ける手札が1枚だけならダブルタップで出します" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If only one card in your hand fits this pile, double-tap to play it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "つまったら" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're stuck"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらの台札に置くか選んでください" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a pile to play on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せない！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No moves!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せません。めくってください" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No one can play. Flip new cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せる札が無くなったら「めくる」。山札が残っている側が、山札から1枚ずつ台札に置きます。山札が無くなったら、めくらずに手札を出し切れば勝ちです。両方とも山札が無いときは、台札を切り直して一番上の札を入れ替えます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When neither side can play, tap Flip. Each side that still has a stock turns one card onto its pile. Once your stock runs out, you no longer flip: play out your hand to win. If both stocks are empty, the piles are reshuffled to show new top cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なし" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
