            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flick toward a pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札の数字と1つ違いの札（台札が7なら6か8）。A と K もつながります。マークは関係ありません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any card one up or down from a pile's top card (on a 7, play a 6 or 8). A and K connect, too. Suits don't matter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右の台札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
