        }
      }
    },
    "「めくる」を押すと、両方の山札から 1 枚ずつ台札に置かれます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap Flip, and one card from each stock is turned onto the piles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "めくるだけが続いて場が動かないときは、引き分けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If only flips keep happening and nothing moves, the game is a draw."
